====================================================
1. APPLICATION PURPOSE
====================================================

This is a Visitor Management System.

A visitor comes to the company's visitor website.

The visitor should be able to:

1. Enter the employee/visitee Email ID.
2. System automatically fetches the employee details.
3. Display:
   - Visitee Name
   - Employee ID
   - Department
   - Employee Mobile Number
   - Employee Photo
4. Visitor enters their own details.
5. Visitor can capture/upload their photo.
6. Visitor reviews all information.
7. Visitor submits the visit request.
8. System generates a unique Visitor ID.
9. System generates a QR Code.
10. Show a successful registration screen.
11. If the visitor has visited previously, they can enter their Mobile Number.
12. System automatically loads their previous details.
13. Visitor can edit/update those details before submitting a new visit.

